Subject: Re: Estimating Bifactor Indices (PUC, ECV, H, FD) with ordered categorical indicators (using WLSMV or ULSMV)
Message-ID: <wfAnVrej4X4.LlsfMrnBAAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <wfAnVrej4X4.WT_sGbnGAQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
